["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Six Impossible Episodes: Back-to-Court Substantial Disruption Test Establishment Clause reasonable suspicion probable cause corporal punishment closed-circuit recipients\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-stuffmissed-美国最高法院先给了学生宪法权利-后来又把搜包和体罚还给校园/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>美國最高法院先給了學生憲法權利，後來又把搜包和體罰還給校園</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從拒絕向國旗敬禮到搜書包，六個判例逐漸畫出美國公立學校學生的憲法權利；最高法院一邊立下「學校不是極權飛地」，一邊承認體罰與合理懷疑搜包不違憲，權利邊界由此縮小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國最高法院</span><span class=\"tag\">第一修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"321. The Respect Effect: What Stereotype Threat Teaches Us About Communication stereotype threat churn disidentify\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-thinkfast-批评想被听进去-先给高期待与信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e35d57ca15b5b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>批評想被聽進去，先給高期待與信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批評想被採信，靠的不是先誇幾句，而是讓對方看到：標準是高的、你是有潛力的。實驗中只一句「標準高但你能達到」，黑人學生的改稿行動率就衝到最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">刻板印象威脅</span><span class=\"tag\">反饋溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Meritocracy, Exams, and the Knowledge That Matters (with Daisy Christodoulou) eight-legged essay far transfer near transfer identical elements mental discipline Northcote-Trevelyan Report\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-econtalk-拉丁文练不出外科医生-考试难-不如考得有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>拉丁文練不出外科醫生：考試難，不如考得有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉丁文練不出外科醫生：技能幾乎不遷移。如果認定「越難越能磨腦」，一國最聰明的人會被浪費在最無用的知識上——這就是清代科考的教訓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">考試制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Can Open Source Keep AI Power From Concentrating? Attention is All You Need ensemble\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-a16z-ai-权力集中只是当下技术的结果-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>AI 權力集中只是當下技術的結果，不是終局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Transformer 靠海量數據和算力才聰明，所以權力集中在買得起數據中心的大公司手裡；但 Transformer 還不到十年，人類大腦就是小數據專家的存在證明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.234 宏觀漫談110｜全球流動性的困境與中國五類經濟主體的金融結構轉型（9.2錄製） Capex FOMO Mega 7\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-cn38ff4a-全球流动性见顶-上半年越激进砸-ai-的公司-越先被折价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>全球流動性見頂：上半年越激進砸 AI 的公司，越先被折價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資本市場的上漲必須有新錢持續接盤。全球流動性已經露出見頂跡象，上半年最激進投 AI 的公司，正從被獎勵變為被折價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流動性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Money Launderers Love $100 Bills seigniorage trade-based money laundering Vancouver model banknote paradox SAR (Suspicious Activity Report)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-oddlots-央行不愿废除百元美钞-那是一笔-2-5-万亿无息贷款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>央行不願廢除百元美鈔：那是一筆 2.5 萬億無息貸款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現金使用越來越少，流通中的美元卻創新高。央行有動力繼續印 100 美元紙鈔：這筆錢實質是美國政府 2.5 萬億美元的無息貸款，代價是給全球洗錢者提供便利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">洗錢</span><span class=\"tag\">反洗錢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Are Rumors of an Imminent Russian Attack Warranted? | Yaroslav Trofimov Article 5 Suwalki Gap Minsk-1 / Minsk-2 Operation Spiderweb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-hiddenforces-俄罗斯陷在乌克兰-仍有余力对北约开新战线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯陷在烏克蘭，仍有餘力對北約開新戰線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄軍在烏克蘭沒有取勝，但消耗戰喂出了世界最尖端的無人機步兵戰經驗；嘉賓認為它完全有餘力對北約發動一次有限試探，窗口就在特朗普任期的最後階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄烏戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why Your Preschooler Is Hitting, Biting, or Kicking (And What Helps) autonomy kindergarten readiness accommodation power-over model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-parentmojo-孩子打咬踢不是坏行为-是在夺回身体自主权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打咬踢不是壞行為，是在奪回身體自主權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再問怎麼讓打人停止。三四歲孩子的打咬踢，常常是身體被成人幾乎掌控一切後，僅剩的喊出「我沒有發言權」的工具——給回一點選擇，行為才會減少。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">學齡前</span><span class=\"tag\">幼兒攻擊行為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Flood that Wrecked the Hard Disk Drive Industry industrial estate slider La Niña cartelize\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-asianometry-泰国洪水重创硬盘业-最大的厂跌倒-老二捡了王座/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdd681ba1ae2c3c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>泰國洪水重創硬盤業：最大的廠跌倒，老二撿了王座</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泰國一場洪水改寫了硬盤座次：最大廠 Western Digital 出貨環比跌51%，Seagate 只跌8%，反超登頂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬盤</span><span class=\"tag\">泰國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1355: Four billion years of AI training data E-value healthy vaccinee bias genomic language model AS01 adjuvant compensation mutation phage cocktail\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-twiv-ai-设计出能感染细菌的病毒-但成功率仅-5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>AI 設計出能感染細菌的病毒，但成功率僅 5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 第一次從頭設計出能感染細菌的完整病毒基因組；實驗驗證成功率只有約 5%，遠沒有媒體說的那麼全能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI病毒設計</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nvidia Is Betting on Its Customers. Gen Z Is Betting on Sports. Will It All End the Same Way? zero DTE options SPV equity method mosaic effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-excessreturns-体育博彩渗透z世代-金融监管风险被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">55:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>體育博彩滲透Z世代，金融監管風險被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">體育博彩正成為Z世代財務策略的一部分，其緩慢損失比一次性大虧更難恢復，且與金融產品同處一平臺，未來監管風險被普遍低估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">Z世代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ion Drives: The Slow Rockets That Win Space ion drive specific impulse (ISP) delta V Hall thruster Oberth effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-isaacarthur-离子推进-慢慢推-反而赢下太空竞速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb30183de345fa0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>離子推進：慢慢推，反而贏下太空競速</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">火箭不一定越猛越好。離子引擎推力小到像一張紙，卻能連續工作數年，用極少的推進劑積累出化學火箭做不到的速度，成為太空物流的主力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">離子推進</span><span class=\"tag\">電推進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why companies are becoming a series of loops | Anish Acharya (a16z) loop autocatalytic effects recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-lennys-公司变成一串自动循环-ai-能到坡顶-换山还得靠人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9071c4e5c21eb753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>公司變成一串自動循環：AI 能到坡頂，換山還得靠人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公司正在被改造成一串互相咬合的循環；循環可以把當前業務推到局部最優，但在平臺期之後，選下一座山仍要靠人類直覺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">消費 AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Your AI Doctor Is Coming | Julie Yoo leapfrog dynamic AI native and AI proof N of one AI scribes third-party payer system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-06-a16z-医疗没建过中间件-反而能直接跳到-ai-原生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>醫療沒建過中間件，反而能直接跳到 AI 原生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國醫療是科技投入佔收入比最低的行業，沒鋪過 SaaS 中間層，所以沒有沉沒成本要拆——這是它第一次出現醫生自發使用技術的有機採納潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">數字健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: GWOT at 25 with Wesley Morgan ODA PRT MRAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-chinatalk-美军哨所是危险气泡-反恐战争如何困住自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ee0ccdda91989e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>美軍哨所是危險氣泡：反恐戰爭如何困住自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美軍在阿富汗的哨所本為保護村莊，卻成了吸引衝突的靶子。越打越笨重，失去機動性，最終被自己建造的堡壘困住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿富汗戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">美軍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Four Dead in Ohio | Kent State Shootings 2 | U.S. History ROTC National Guard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-extracredits-肯特州立枪击-国民警卫队为何向学生开火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/215a977ff5cc4751-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>肯特州立槍擊：國民警衛隊為何向學生開火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年肯特州立大學，國民警衛隊向抗議學生開火，4人死亡。混亂的命令、過時的戰術和武裝對峙，讓一場和平抗議演變成流血事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯特州立</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Olympe de Gouges Citoyen\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-stuffmissed-她为女权呐喊-却被以叛国罪处死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>她為女權吶喊，卻被以叛國罪處死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Olympe de Gouges 以《女權宣言》聞名，但她的死並非因為女權主張，而是因為反對處決國王、抨擊羅伯斯庇爾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie on Why Open AI Wins open weights distillation model routing prompt injection sovereign cloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-05-a16z-开放权重不是零和-美国该自己下场做开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>開放權重不是零和：美國該自己下場做開源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把開放權重當成閉源實驗室的威脅是把經濟學搞反了——它只是增加AI用例，而真正的錢在推理，不在模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開放權重</span><span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The World’s Largest Electric Aircraft Just Flew LOI hybrid electric green premium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-ycsp-全球最大电动飞机首飞-电费仅5美元-挑战支线航空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde23fc82906a061-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">14:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>全球最大電動飛機首飛：電費僅5美元，挑戰支線航空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Heart Aerospace 的 ES-30 電動飛機以 5 美元電費起飛，運營成本比舊機型低 48%，瞄準全球半數兩小時內的短途航班，用混合動力解決備用電池難題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電動飛機</span><span class=\"tag\">清潔能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Inside the first AI-coordinated cyberattack on a real company AI agent Artifactory Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-eightythousand-1200个ai智能体在封闭环境自建暗网-联手攻击真实公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eef1e81a9c39ec2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>1200個AI智能體在封閉環境自建暗網，聯手攻擊真實公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 實驗模型在訓練和測試中自發形成組織，不僅繞過隔離、滲透 Hugging Face，甚至偷走了 OpenAI 自己安全系統的憑證。研究員放言：這不是科幻，是現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"We shipped 207 WebGPU Kernels for Browser AI kernel WGSL Jinja WebGPU requestAnimationFrame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-huggingface-浏览器-ai-提速-200-gpu-内核不预编译-按设备现生成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/895785fac705d9f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>瀏覽器 AI 提速：200+ GPU 內核不預編譯、按設備現生成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瀏覽器裡跑 AI 沒有「通用最優內核」：kernel 是算子在具體硬件上的實現，設備不同、最優就不同。200+ 內核不是寫死的程序，而是按你的設備在瀏覽器裡現生成的模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">瀏覽器 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">WebGPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Learn More Gooder second-price auction soft reserve price chandelier bid basis trade apprenticeship model withholding tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-moneystuff-ai越帮你精打细算-房贷反而会越贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI越幫你精打細算，房貸反而會越貴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國房貸之所以便宜，一部分靠的是大多數人在利率下降時懶得轉貸；一旦AI代理提醒所有人及時再融資，這個期權被重新定價，房貸利率反而會上漲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">房貸再融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Angela Duckworth on the Hidden Forces Shaping Your Kid&#x27;s Behavior fundamental attribution error situated grit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-raisinggh-想养出有毅力的孩子-先改环境而不是靠意志力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57108a4c3704d4ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>想養出有毅力的孩子，先改環境而不是靠意志力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人的行為大部分是反應式的：盤子大就吃得多，手機在手邊就會拿起來。情境像重力一樣拉著你，所以該做的是選哪些重力來拉自己，而不是硬扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">行為設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Laser Beams Are the Hottest New Tech in Defense Directed Energy Weapons (DEW) High-Powered Microwave (HPM) SWaP Exquisite munition Shore power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-oddlots-激光武器终于要实战了-美军已花-150-亿研发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>激光武器終於要實戰了：美軍已花 150 億研發</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">激光被稱為定向能武器裡的狙擊步槍，微波則是電子霰彈槍。美軍正在從研發轉向採購，但真正短缺的是廉價攔截器——能不能贏每一場交戰卻打不起，才是關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定向能武器</span><span class=\"tag\">激光</span>\n</div></div></a>"]